commit 4e2a03b6b6e0c0d1c4edea10dc1aae63eeb6c581
Author: Behdad Esfahbod <behdad@behdad.org>
Date:   Tue Nov 27 17:40:09 2018 -0500

    Comment

 src/hb-machinery.hh | 4 +++-
