    [hb-view] Support --features
    
    Accepts values like:
    
      --features="-mkmk,aalt=2,calt=1,+cswh"
    
    A minus sign means "=0", a plus sign means "=1".  Default is "=1".
    A minus sign overrides an explicit value.

